0e1ria e do Consumidor, buscando solu\u00e7\u00f5es eficientes nas esferas administrativa e judicial.<\/p><p>Sua atua\u00e7\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m contempla assessoria e correspond\u00eancia jur\u00eddica, com orienta\u00e7\u00e3o personalizada e an\u00e1lise estrat\u00e9gica de cada caso. Na \u00e1rea previdenci\u00e1ria, presta assist\u00eancia em demandas relacionadas ao INSS, incluindo benef\u00edcios, aux\u00edlios, aposentadorias e pens\u00f5es, sempre visando \u00e0 prote\u00e7\u00e3o dos direitos e \u00e0 melhor solu\u00e7\u00e3o para seus clientes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d992702 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d992702\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"servicos\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f0555bf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6f0555bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-497d4f80 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"497d4f80\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">\u00c1REAS DE ATUA\u00c7\u00c3O<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f632ca8 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"f632ca8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-setti